  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Border management in Mali/ Niger/ Burkina Faso region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Border management in Mali/ Niger/ Burkina Faso region is a component of Strategic Alliance on Conflict Prevention and Development in the Sahel (CSSF) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;395,000. This project benefits South of Sahara, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Civilian peace-building, conflict prevention and resolution.</narrative>
  </description>
